** Storage Classes of AWS S3
Typical lifecycle for raw data
Day 0-30: S3 Standard (just landed, being processed and validated)
After 30 days: Standard-IA (occasional reprocessing)
After 90 days: Glacier Flexible Retrieval
After 180+ days: Deep Archive, optionally with an expiry rule after the retention period ends

